# local scratch, not part of the project
Awaiting your selection.zip
repo.bundle

# private notes, never published
NOTES.local.md
dist/*.dmg

# Client and work data. This repository is public, so anything exported from
# a customer system is a disclosure if it is ever staged. Patterns rather
# than filenames, because the next export will have a different date in it.
#
# The file that prompted this: an LMCU Jira export carrying a client's
# project history, ticket contents and real names. It was sitting untracked
# in the working directory with nothing stopping `git add -A` from
# publishing it.
*jira*.json
*-raw-*.json
lmcu-*
*.export.json

# Spreadsheets and archives are almost never source in this project, and are
# the usual shape of data that arrived from somewhere else.
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.zip
!publish/*.zip
